  "support_screen_title": "Support",
  "support_screen_contacts_text": "Contact Us",
  "support_screen_contacts_decription": "For any problems or questions, write to:",
  "support_screen_contacts_info": "ndn21dev@gmail.com",
  "support_screen_faq_text": "FAq",
  "support_screen_faq_decription": "Find answers to the most frequently asked questions.",
  "support_screen_faq_q1": "How to add a pair of shoes?",
  "support_screen_faq_a1": "To add a pair of shoes, go to the Home and click on the '+' button. Fill in all the necessary details and save.",
  "support_screen_faq_q2": "How to edit a pair of shoes?",
  "support_screen_faq_a2": "To edit a pair of shoes, select the shoe box you want to edit and click on it. Once open, click on the icon in the top right corner and select the 'Edit' option. Make the changes and save.",
  "support_screen_faq_q3": "How to delete a pair of shoes?",
  "support_screen_faq_a3": "To delete a pair of shoes, select the shoe box you want to edit and click on it. Once open, click on the icon in the top right corner and select the 'Delete' option.",
  "support_screen_faq_q4": "What happens if I delete a pair of shoes?",
  "support_screen_faq_a4": "If you delete a pair of shoes, it will be permanently removed. You will be asked to confirm before proceeding with the operation.",
  "support_screen_faq_q5": "Can I see the history of added or deleted pairs of shoes?",
  "support_screen_faq_a5": "Yes, you can see the entire history of actions performed in the 'History' section.",

  "support_screen_faq_q7": "What can I do if the app doesn't work properly?",
  "support_screen_faq_a7": "If you encounter problems, try restarting the app. If the problem persists, contact technical support through the 'Contact Us' section.",
